              <zone forceUpdate='true' h='79125' id='8' type-v2='text' w='98934' x='533' y='19875'>
                <formatted-text>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'>This dashboard provides </run>
                  <run fontcolor='#292a2e' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'>Subcategory Product Ads Opportunity Dashboard for CPC Ads.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#292a2e' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'>For more details -  </run>
                  <run auto-url='true' fontcolor='#292a2e' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12' hyperlink='tabdoc:load-url url=&amp;quot;https://atlassian.cloud.deliveryhero.group/wiki/spaces/GBU/pages/107450641/MLOTT+Subcategory+Ads&amp;quot;'>https://atlassian.cloud.deliveryhero.group/wiki/spaces/GBU/pages/107450641/MLOTT+Subcategory+Ads</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#b82125' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'>Details and Assumptions</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'>The report is a combination of Inventory reporting and demand hunting . </run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'>&gt; Category Parent is the master_category_L2_english (backend) coming form catalog.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'>&gt; Category Parent is the master_category_L3_english (backend) coming form catalog.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'>&gt; Data is sorted based on the Total GMV for the selected filters.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'>&gt; Fill rate is calculated using the actual impressions vs potential impressions.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12' italic='true'>&gt; </run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'> Timeframe - ISO Week</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'>&gt; Potential Revenue  </run>
                  <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'>Potential Impression*Floor Price*avg monthly CTRL2 category</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12' italic='true'>&gt; </run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'> Floor price is converted to euro, based on the average exchange rate for the week.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'>For further updates please follow the </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'>talabat_growth_centre</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'>,</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12' italic='true'>qc_advertising_analytics</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'> channel on Slack</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#990000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'>Note : </run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'>&gt; Please don&apos;t use the dashboard for revenue reporting. </run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'>&gt; While comparing data between Demand hunting and MLOTT, kindly make sure the timelines and the business types are accurate.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                </formatted-text>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
            </zone>
          </zone>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='margin' value='8' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
      </zones>
